  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758896,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1.000 Miler: A Commodore 64 Adventure\n\nEmbark on a thrilling cross-country race against the clock in *1.000 Miler* for the Commodore 64! Inspired by the classic TV game show *The $100,000 Pyramid*, this game challenges your quick thinking and communication skills. \n\nAs a contestant, you'll navigate a sprawling map of the United States, competing in a series of timed rounds. Each round presents a category filled with related words – think \"things that are red\" or \"types of vehicles.\" Your goal? To cleverly provide clues to your partner (or, in single-player mode, yourself!) without uttering the actual words. \n\nSuccess unlocks faster travel and propels you closer to the finish line. But beware! Incorrect guesses and wasted time will slow you down. Master the art of subtle hints, strategize your route, and outwit your opponents to become the ultimate champion and conquer the 1,000-mile challenge! Experience the excitement of a race against time and test your wordplay prowess in this unique and engaging Commodore 64 adventure."
    },
